{"id":1050103,"chapter_id":1050103,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"幸运的是，少女并没有因为爆炸而死，也没有被流沙吞噬。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103001,"trial_step":1},{"step":2,"content":"她让很多人失望了，但只要有一个人认可了她，这一切就是值得的。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103002,"trial_step":2},{"step":3,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"局长，轮到你了。","voice":["vo_trial_50103_1_3"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":1022,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103003,"trial_step":3},{"step":4,"content":"艾——米——潘！莓——丝——！听得到吗！","style":3,"background":1022,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103004,"trial_step":4},{"step":5,"content":"而你仍旧沉浸在刚才关于少女的结局之中。","style":3,"background":1022,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103005,"trial_step":5},{"step":6,"content":"抱歉……这个故事还真是……","style":2,"background":1022,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103006,"trial_step":6},{"step":7,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"这不是故事，这是我父亲给我的一次考验。","voice":["vo_trial_50103_1_7"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":1022,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103007,"trial_step":7},{"step":8,"content":"我知道，只不过……稍微有点匪夷所思。","style":2,"background":1022,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103008,"trial_step":8},{"step":9,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"我记得我说过，他能稳坐在现在的位置上，脚下可踩着不少自己的亲骨肉。","voice":["vo_trial_50103_1_9"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":1022,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103009,"trial_step":9},{"step":10,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"如果我死了，那证明我能力不足以待在他身边。","voice":["vo_trial_50103_1_10"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":1022,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103010,"trial_step":10},{"step":11,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"但庆幸的是，我不仅没死……还觉醒了能力。","voice":["vo_trial_50103_1_11"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":1022,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103011,"trial_step":11},{"step":12,"content":"你在那时就成为了禁闭者……！","style":2,"background":1022,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103012,"trial_step":12},{"step":13,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"是啊……同样是自己的孩子成为了禁闭者，我听说过两种态度。","voice":["vo_trial_50103_1_13"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":1022,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103013,"trial_step":13},{"step":14,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"一是对其更加保护，不愿让政府带走，不愿失去。","voice":["vo_trial_50103_1_14"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":1022,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103014,"trial_step":14},{"step":15,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"另一种，则是像丢一块抹布一般，生怕自己和禁闭者产生一点儿联系。","voice":["vo_trial_50103_1_15"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":1022,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103015,"trial_step":15},{"step":16,"options":["那……你呢？"],"style":6,"background":1022,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103016,"trial_step":16,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"那……你呢？","goto":17}]},{"step":17,"content":"伊琳娜耸耸肩，熟练地把一颗棋子落在你的位置上，“吃”掉了你的棋子，你认出来，那枚是王后。","style":3,"background":1022,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103017,"trial_step":17},{"step":18,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"我猜得没错，买通砂盗在航路上堵我的，就是我的父亲。","voice":["vo_trial_50103_1_18"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":1022,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103018,"trial_step":18},{"step":19,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"他的意思很明确——死了，就当没我这个女儿，活着……那说明我还能用。","voice":["vo_trial_50103_1_19"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":1022,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103019,"trial_step":19},{"step":20,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"所以当我活下来……当我成为了禁闭者的时候，他很欣慰。","voice":["vo_trial_50103_1_20"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":1022,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103020,"trial_step":20},{"step":21,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"他让我为自己感到骄傲——因为他将会派遣我来到狄斯城，为他的大计打下基础。","voice":["vo_trial_50103_1_21"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":1022,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103021,"trial_step":21},{"step":22,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"这句话，是他第二次说，第一次让我为自己感到骄傲的时候，是我唯一一次下棋赢了他。","voice":["vo_trial_50103_1_22"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":1022,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103022,"trial_step":22},{"step":23,"content":"谈话间，伊琳娜再次围困住了你的棋子，棋盘上的战况没有分析价值，基本是伊琳娜凌冽地“吃掉”你。","style":3,"background":1022,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103023,"trial_step":23},{"step":24,"content":"也就是说，奎恩集团，是你在你父亲的授意下治理起来的？","style":2,"background":1022,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103024,"trial_step":24},{"step":25,"content":"你朝旁边挪动了一步棋，决定挣扎一下让出位置，让王有机会出来。","style":3,"background":1022,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103025,"trial_step":25},{"step":26,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"对，他帮我规划好路径，只要按他说的去做，就不会有差池——当然，他“说的”内容，想要完成起来，并不简单。","voice":["vo_trial_50103_1_26"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":1022,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103026,"trial_step":26},{"step":27,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"可我到底是坎贝尔家的人，天生……就带着不甘被掌控的血液吧。","voice":["vo_trial_50103_1_27"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":1022,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103027,"trial_step":27},{"step":28,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"我以为我可以一点点地蚕食他的势力，结果没想到……还是栽了。","voice":["vo_trial_50103_1_28"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":1022,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103028,"trial_step":28},{"step":29,"content":"伊琳娜的眼神低垂，看着棋盘不知道在想些什么。","style":3,"background":1022,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103029,"trial_step":29},{"step":30,"content":"这也是我希望你能跟我一起去费沙的原因。","style":2,"background":1022,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103030,"trial_step":30},{"step":31,"content":"于公，我不能让禁闭者被掌握在别人手里，于私……我认为你的能力并不逊色，确实不应该被他掌控。","style":2,"background":1022,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103031,"trial_step":31},{"step":32,"content":"以及我想要辩解一下，枷锁……并非是一种掌控……","style":2,"background":1022,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103032,"trial_step":32},{"step":33,"content":"哒！一声清脆的落子声响起，伊琳娜的嘴角微微上扬，打断了你的话。","style":3,"background":1022,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103033,"trial_step":33},{"step":34,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"将军。","voice":["vo_trial_50103_1_34"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":1022,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103034,"trial_step":34},{"step":35,"content":"什么？","style":2,"background":1022,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103035,"trial_step":35},{"step":36,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"抱歉，你输了，局长。","voice":["vo_trial_50103_1_36"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":1022,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103036,"trial_step":36},{"step":37,"content":"棋盘上，你方才费尽心思挪出来的王，被伊琳娜的后占据了位置，陷入死局。","style":3,"background":1022,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103037,"trial_step":37},{"step":38,"options":["……"],"style":6,"background":1022,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103038,"trial_step":38,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"……","goto":39}]},{"step":39,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"这是一盘“快速对决”。你作为一个初学者，面对我的表现已经足够优秀了。","voice":["vo_trial_50103_1_39"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":1022,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103039,"trial_step":39},{"step":40,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"不过……谢谢你，局长，我的思路清晰多了。","voice":["vo_trial_50103_1_40"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":1022,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103040,"trial_step":40},{"step":41,"content":"你看着被黑棋侵蚀的棋盘，有些不解——她真的在迷茫吗？","style":3,"background":1022,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103041,"trial_step":41},{"step":42,"content":"既然如此……那你的答复呢？","style":2,"background":1022,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103042,"trial_step":42},{"step":43,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"我会和你一起去的……我确实应该摆脱控制了。","voice":["vo_trial_50103_1_43"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":1022,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103043,"trial_step":43},{"step":44,"content":"伊琳娜拿起桌面上的许可证，对你莞尔一笑。","style":3,"background":1022,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103044,"trial_step":44},{"step":45,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"我随时都能出发。","voice":["vo_trial_50103_1_45"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":1022,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103045,"trial_step":45},{"step":46,"content":"砂航船的驾驶舱没有窗户，只能透过航行板观察外面的情况。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103046,"trial_step":46},{"step":47,"content":"离开那道高耸的墙壁，周围的建筑在一点点变矮、减少。沙子被风和船桨扬起，渐渐地蒙在了天上。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103047,"trial_step":47},{"step":48,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"……","voice":["vo_trial_50103_1_48"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103048,"trial_step":48},{"step":49,"options":["怎么了？","难道是晕船……？"],"style":6,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103049,"trial_step":49,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"怎么了？","goto":50},{"text":"难道是晕船……？","goto":null}]},{"step":50,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"没有，只是我发现，这艘砂航船，和那时……和我家族的船很像。","voice":["vo_trial_50103_1_50"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103050,"trial_step":50},{"step":51,"content":"这确实是以坎贝尔家族的航船所仿制的，和费沙城的贸易条件里，有砂航船的制作图纸，而且如果我没记错，奎恩集团旗下也有砂航船的制作公司吧？","style":2,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103051,"trial_step":51},{"step":52,"content":"伊琳娜小姐会不知道吗？这听上去比我以为你会晕船还要离谱些。","style":2,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103052,"trial_step":52},{"step":53,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"抱歉，因为这艘船型号有点旧，我以为你们会使用奎恩新型的砂航船，我想那会快很多。","voice":["vo_trial_50103_1_53"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103053,"trial_step":53},{"step":54,"content":"……只是为了给费沙城一些“尊重”。","style":2,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103054,"trial_step":54},{"step":55,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"这里离白砂公海还有大概三十分钟的路程，要继续和我下棋吗？局长？","voice":["vo_trial_50103_1_55"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103055,"trial_step":55},{"step":56,"options":["要","不要"],"style":6,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103056,"trial_step":56,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"要","goto":57},{"text":"不要","goto":59}]},{"step":57,"content":"不知道三十分钟，能否让我成为一个和坎贝尔先生也能过上一两招的人？","style":2,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103057,"trial_step":57},{"step":58,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"您可真是个理想主义者。","voice":["vo_trial_50103_1_58"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103058,"trial_step":58,"next":[61]},{"step":59,"content":"这段时间都足够你秒杀我五六次了，伊琳娜小姐。","style":2,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103059,"trial_step":59},{"step":60,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"这很有趣，不是吗？","voice":["vo_trial_50103_1_60"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103060,"trial_step":60},{"step":61,"content":"伊琳娜耸耸肩，饶有趣味地看着你。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103061,"trial_step":61},{"step":62,"content":"她明明才刚向你说完那个可怕的故事没多久，但她的脸上似乎没有丝毫畏惧，哪怕要见曾经置她于死地的亲人。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103062,"trial_step":62},{"step":63,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"或许这就是为什么坎贝尔家族的人能这么成功的原因吧。","voice":["vo_trial_50103_1_63"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103063,"trial_step":63},{"step":64,"content":"伊琳娜像是看穿了你的想法。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103064,"trial_step":64},{"step":65,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"商场如战场，是没有情分可言的。","voice":["vo_trial_50103_1_65"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103065,"trial_step":65},{"step":66,"content":"……","style":2,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103066,"trial_step":66},{"step":67,"content":"这句话之后，你与伊琳娜没有再交谈一句。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103067,"trial_step":67},{"step":68,"content":"航行板上，窗外的颜色早已变得连成一片的白，没有其他杂色，你知道，你们大约已经跨入公海了。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103068,"trial_step":68},{"step":69,"content":"你们即将要去面对那个堪称冷酷无情的商人——普莱西·坎贝尔。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103069,"trial_step":69},{"step":70,"speaker":"震动声","content":"轰轰轰——","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103070,"trial_step":70},{"step":71,"content":"什么声音？","style":2,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103071,"trial_step":71},{"step":72,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"是砂航船的……你们还有其他人一起跟来了？","voice":["vo_trial_50103_1_72"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103072,"trial_step":72},{"step":73,"content":"没有，我们这次的主要目的并不是武力冲突。","style":2,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103073,"trial_step":73},{"step":74,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"……","voice":["vo_trial_50103_1_74"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103074,"trial_step":74},{"step":75,"speaker":"驾驶员","content":"局长，我们的航道上突然出现数艘旧型号砂航船！","voice":["vo_trial_50103_1_75"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103075,"trial_step":75},{"step":76,"speaker":"驾驶员","content":"并……并且都是以备战状态朝我们开过来！我们已经进入了射程范围！","voice":["vo_trial_50103_1_76"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103076,"trial_step":76},{"step":77,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"是坎贝尔的货船，局长。","voice":["vo_trial_50103_1_77"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103077,"trial_step":77},{"step":78,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"型号虽然旧，但装载的武器和数量的加持，对我们来说是致命打击。","voice":["vo_trial_50103_1_78"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103078,"trial_step":78},{"step":79,"content":"正说着，隐隐约约的喊话声，传入了驾驶舱内。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103079,"trial_step":79},{"step":80,"content":"那些人高喊着普莱西的名字，让MBCC的局长滚蛋，或是去亲吻普莱西的脚趾。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103080,"trial_step":80},{"step":81,"content":"这次的行动是伪装成了普通的贸易访问，我们被出卖了。","style":2,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103081,"trial_step":81},{"step":82,"content":"正在你紧皱眉头，思考着应该怎么办时——密集的火炮已经在你们周围炸开，下一轮的炮击，说不定就会命中船舱。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103082,"trial_step":82},{"step":83,"content":"伊琳娜……","style":2,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103083,"trial_step":83},{"step":84,"content":"你抬起头来，直视着她。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103084,"trial_step":84},{"step":85,"content":"接收到你的视线，她轻声笑了起来。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103085,"trial_step":85},{"step":86,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"如果你能信任我……就请让我来驾驶吧。","voice":["vo_trial_50103_1_86"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103086,"trial_step":86},{"step":87,"content":"我也希望你能信任我的选择。","style":2,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103087,"trial_step":87},{"step":88,"content":"伊琳娜绕过你，径直走向驾驶位，开始进行操作。她的动作行云流水，没有丝毫犹豫。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103088,"trial_step":88},{"step":89,"content":"对面的货船还在攻击，可是你们的船在伊琳娜的驾驶下，开始回避和后退了。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103089,"trial_step":89},{"step":90,"speaker":"驾驶员","content":"这……这条路是安全的吗？我们还没有检测过是否有流沙……","voice":["vo_trial_50103_1_90"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103090,"trial_step":90},{"step":91,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"坎贝尔家族的人，闭着眼睛都能从这砂海跑出去。","voice":["vo_trial_50103_1_91"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103091,"trial_step":91},{"step":92,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"你难道没有听过这样一句话吗？","voice":["vo_trial_50103_1_92"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103092,"trial_step":92},{"step":93,"content":"伊琳娜手上的操作没停下来，眼睛却对着驾驶员眨了眨。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103093,"trial_step":93},{"step":94,"speaker":"驾驶员","content":"抱歉……","voice":["vo_trial_50103_1_94"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103094,"trial_step":94},{"step":95,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"……嗯，毕竟你还很年轻。","voice":["vo_trial_50103_1_95"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103095,"trial_step":95},{"step":96,"content":"在伊琳娜的操控下，你们的砂航船开始往别的方向驶去，尽管坎贝尔的货船追得很紧，但没有任何一枚炮弹打中你们。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103096,"trial_step":96},{"step":97,"content":"伊琳娜的操控之熟练，就好像这艘船，便是当年陪她一起出生入死的船只一样。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103097,"trial_step":97},{"step":98,"content":"辛苦你驾驶，其他武装成员，跟我一起到甲板上去——","style":2,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103098,"trial_step":98},{"step":99,"content":"那些人许久不朝我们“打招呼”了，不知道他们在谋划着什么东西。","style":2,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103099,"trial_step":99},{"step":100,"content":"你率领着一批人来到甲板上，查看着船只的尾部。果然不出你的所料，他们不知道什么时候，将绳索系在了你们的船尾，正一个个地跳上你们的货船。","style":3,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103100,"trial_step":100},{"step":101,"content":"阻止他们，不能让他们进入驾驶舱！","style":2,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103101,"trial_step":101},{"step":102,"content":"你指挥队员散开，对那些入侵者进行反击。","style":3,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103102,"trial_step":102},{"step":103,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"小心，10点钟方向的货船正在向你们进行射击！抓稳！","voice":["vo_trial_50103_1_103"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":11,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103103,"trial_step":103},{"step":104,"content":"伊琳娜的声音通过船上的广播传来，你连忙往侧面扑去，卧在集装箱后。","style":3,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103104,"trial_step":104},{"step":105,"content":"砰————！！","style":3,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103105,"trial_step":105},{"step":106,"content":"随着巨大的爆炸声响起，整艘船像是被一只无形的大手抓着拼命摇晃了一会儿。","style":3,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103106,"trial_step":106},{"step":107,"content":"硝烟散去，你这才发现，你们还是中弹了。","style":3,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103107,"trial_step":107},{"step":108,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"呃……抱、抱歉，局长，我没能避开刚才那一击。","voice":["vo_trial_50103_1_108"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":11,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103108,"trial_step":108},{"step":109,"content":"伊琳娜的声音也有些虚弱，或许是刚才的冲击让她也撞在了什么上面。","style":3,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103109,"trial_step":109},{"step":110,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"开炮的人一定是个老手，竟然在发射的瞬间改变弹道……太疯了……","voice":["vo_trial_50103_1_110"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":11,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103110,"trial_step":110},{"step":111,"content":"然而不等你们缓过来，第二枚炮弹竟然再次发射出来了。","style":3,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103111,"trial_step":111},{"step":112,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"局长！快进行回避！！","voice":["vo_trial_50103_1_112"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103112,"trial_step":112},{"step":113,"content":"伊琳娜的声音没有了电流的噪音——船已经停下，她从驾驶舱内走了出来。","style":3,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103113,"trial_step":113},{"step":114,"content":"她一脸严肃，朝着飞来的炮弹举起了手。","style":3,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103114,"trial_step":114},{"step":115,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"你不会再得逞了。","voice":["vo_trial_50103_1_115"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103115,"trial_step":115},{"step":116,"content":"炮弹在半空径直爆炸，碎片和火光在空中绽开，渣滓噼里啪啦地落在了甲板上。","style":3,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103116,"trial_step":116},{"step":117,"content":"——这是伊琳娜的异能。","style":3,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103117,"trial_step":117},{"step":118,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"局长，你可以对我下命令的。","voice":["vo_trial_50103_1_118"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103118,"trial_step":118},{"step":119,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"不然，你和我很有可能没法活着回去。","voice":["vo_trial_50103_1_119"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103119,"trial_step":119},{"step":120,"content":"什么意思？！","style":2,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103120,"trial_step":120},{"step":121,"content":"伊琳娜苦笑着，指了指对面的船。","style":3,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103121,"trial_step":121},{"step":122,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"他……亲自来了，操控炮弹的那个人，就是他。","voice":["vo_trial_50103_1_122"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103122,"trial_step":122},{"step":123,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"我的一切本领都是他教的，我不可能赢得了他。","voice":["vo_trial_50103_1_123"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103123,"trial_step":123},{"step":124,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"除非……你同意我使用异能。","voice":["vo_trial_50103_1_124"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103124,"trial_step":124},{"step":125,"content":"谈话间，炮弹一而再再而三地发射过来，都被伊琳娜拦在了半空之中，但不难看出，对面无论如何，都想要毁了这条船，就算仍有自己的人也在这艘船上。","style":3,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103125,"trial_step":125},{"step":126,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"局长，这是我们唯一的方法了。","voice":["vo_trial_50103_1_126"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103126,"trial_step":126},{"step":127,"content":"你紧握住拳头，指甲硌在掌心里，可是你的手早就因为开枪而变得麻木，感受不到疼痛了。","style":3,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103127,"trial_step":127},{"step":128,"content":"你知道眼下的局面是一个你死我活的局面，但你并不想让伊琳娜使用能力——再怎么样，对面的是她的父亲，她……至少曾经崇敬着他。","style":3,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103128,"trial_step":128},{"step":129,"options":["允许伊琳娜使用异能","不允许伊琳娜使用异能"],"style":6,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103129,"trial_step":129,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"允许伊琳娜使用异能","goto":130},{"text":"不允许伊琳娜使用异能","goto":131}]},{"step":130,"content":"但是，我不允许你用异能攻击他，把他所有的炮弹拦下来即可。","style":2,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103130,"trial_step":130,"next":[132]},{"step":131,"content":"你的异能不能作用于人类。","style":2,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103131,"trial_step":131},{"step":132,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"什么……？","voice":["vo_trial_50103_1_132"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103132,"trial_step":132},{"step":133,"content":"意思就是，你的异能，只能用来阻拦炮弹，剩下的，交给我就好。","style":2,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103133,"trial_step":133},{"step":134,"content":"你转过身去，召集了剩余的人护送你跑进驾驶舱。","style":3,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103134,"trial_step":134},{"step":135,"content":"砂海气候特殊，接下来是否有暴风天气？","style":2,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103135,"trial_step":135},{"step":136,"speaker":"驾驶员","content":"是的，大概还有三分钟左右。","voice":["vo_trial_50103_1_136"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103136,"trial_step":136},{"step":137,"content":"好，我会让伊琳娜尽量在三分钟后留出一段时间，你们趁机瞄准对面……","style":2,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103137,"trial_step":137},{"step":138,"content":"尽可能解决目标。","style":2,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103138,"trial_step":138},{"step":139,"speaker":"驾驶员","content":"……明白。","voice":["vo_trial_50103_1_139"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103139,"trial_step":139},{"step":140,"content":"你拿起武器架上的一杆狙击枪，示意其他战斗人员也跟上你。","style":3,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103140,"trial_step":140},{"step":141,"content":"天渐渐地阴沉了下来，不知道是因为炮弹的硝烟，还是因为乌云。","style":3,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103141,"trial_step":141},{"step":142,"content":"风开始逐渐变强，那些在伊琳娜使用异能阻挡在空中炸开的炮弹的黑烟开始一点一点地被吹散开来。","style":3,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103142,"trial_step":142},{"step":143,"content":"你蹲靠在瞭望塔上，架着那把长枪，身后的士兵们也都严阵以待。","style":3,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103143,"trial_step":143},{"step":144,"content":"你的眼里，只剩下瞄准镜内那一方小小的视野。","style":3,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103144,"trial_step":144},{"step":145,"content":"你在等待着，等待那个人在风暴前出现……","style":3,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103145,"trial_step":145},{"step":146,"content":"所有人，瞄准2点钟方向——","style":2,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103146,"trial_step":146},{"step":147,"content":"一抹黑色，从窗口的边缘闯入你的视野。","style":3,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103147,"trial_step":147},{"step":148,"content":"人影向前探出半个身子，似乎是想要亲自操作炮塔。","style":3,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103148,"trial_step":148},{"step":149,"content":"你知道，这是最好，也是最后的机会了。","style":1,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103149,"trial_step":149},{"step":150,"options":["开火！"],"style":6,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103150,"trial_step":150,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"开火！","goto":151}]},{"step":151,"content":"通讯器中回荡着此起彼伏的枪声，你看见目标在齐射中缓缓倒下。","style":3,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103151,"trial_step":151},{"step":152,"content":"渐渐逼近船体的炮弹，染红了天空。但，它们就像被什么东西阻挡住一样，不再继续飞行，而是挣扎着，扭曲着，在天空中炸开。","style":3,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103152,"trial_step":152},{"step":153,"content":"伊琳娜的能力果然恐怖。","style":3,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103153,"trial_step":153},{"step":154,"content":"……成功了吗？","style":2,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103154,"trial_step":154},{"step":155,"content":"风还在吹，眼前的遮挡被尽数吹开。值得庆幸的是，对面没有再发动攻击，一抹鲜红从对面的炮塔上流下，你终于松了一口气。","style":3,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103155,"trial_step":155},{"step":156,"content":"你的手还在颤抖，走下瞭望塔时，你拆下了弹夹将枪递给士兵们。一边调侃了句怎么抖得这么厉害。","style":3,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103156,"trial_step":156},{"step":157,"content":"你无奈地笑笑，走到伊琳娜的身边。","style":3,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103157,"trial_step":157},{"step":158,"content":"伊琳娜立在船头，眼睛却不愿意看向她父亲所在的船。","style":3,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103158,"trial_step":158},{"step":159,"content":"抱歉，我能做的，只有不让你亲自动手。","style":2,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103159,"trial_step":159},{"step":160,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"……我知道你的意思。","voice":["vo_trial_50103_1_160"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103160,"trial_step":160},{"step":161,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"我只是不相信，他……真的就这样死了。","voice":["vo_trial_50103_1_161"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103161,"trial_step":161},{"step":162,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"可能因为……确实老了。","voice":["vo_trial_50103_1_162"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103162,"trial_step":162},{"step":163,"content":"船尾被炮弹炸出来的缺口上，一片坚硬的钢铁被削断，像风烛残年的老人一般，摇晃着呻吟。","style":3,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103163,"trial_step":163},{"step":164,"content":"随后承受不住风的压力，轰然坠落。","style":3,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103164,"trial_step":164},{"step":165,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"走吧，局长，去见证坎贝尔的更迭吧。","voice":["vo_trial_50103_1_165"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103165,"trial_step":165},{"step":166,"content":"嗯，不过我们得先去收拾一下，把证据都保留下来。我想坎贝尔家的人，应该都像他一样不好对付。","style":2,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150103166,"trial_step":166},{"step":167,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"啊，那就顺便告诉你……","voice":["vo_tria